# Managed by omarchy-shared-config (used on laptops only).
# Apps frozen (SIGSTOP) while the laptop lid is closed and the laptop keeps
# running, continued (SIGCONT) when the lid opens. One process or executable
# name per line, case-insensitive (see `omarchy-lid-quiet list`).
# Terminals, browsers, Grok Bot, Voxtype, Sunshine, Tailscale, ssh and local
# AI servers are never frozen, even if listed here.
# Web apps (e.g. WhatsApp in a Brave app window) run inside Brave and can't
# be frozen separately.
signal-desktop
signal
telegram-desktop
telegram
spotify
discord
vesktop
slack
ente
